Vramsteg has been built and tested on the following configurations:

  * macOS 10.12 Sierra
  * Debian 7.0 Wheezy (stable) and 6.0 Squeeze (oldstable) plus Sid (testing)

---

While Vramsteg has undergone testing, bugs are sure to remain.
If you encounter a bug, please send a message to:

  support@gothenburgbitfactory.org

and check for updates at https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/vramsteg.

Thank you.
